SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (July 16th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with H
 eart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\, the futur
 e\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for meaning in li
 fe :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://youtu.be/v
 ei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful songw
 riting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Life reflecti
 on and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand yourself better
 \n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about o
 rdinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the searc
 h for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting at 
 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Fle
 mming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveF
 lemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Hear
 t (Thursday\, July 16th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's songs explor
 e the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imagination\, a
 nd heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, blue eyed s
 oul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches on themes of lov
 e\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\, personal growt
 h\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs often feature mem
 orable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical questions\, and a dee
 p curiosity about life and human nature. Whether telling a story\, sharing
  a life lesson\, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or reflecting on the st
 ate of the world\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, connection\, compa
 ssion\, and a greater appreciation for the journey we all share\n\n**Songs
  containing:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine c
 raftsmanship\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a prolific f
 olk-country songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary people\, gratitude\,
  personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning.
 \n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis songs explore freed
 om\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom hidden in or
 dinary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You C
 an: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n**
 steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly app
 reciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings among music lov
 ers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
